 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "ロペスさん、こんばんは。五時半から準備しているんですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D001-S01",
    "C39-D001-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 4.157,
   "duration_sec": 4.157
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい。入力を「USB」にしましたが、パソコンの写真が見えません。どうすればいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D002-S01",
    "C39-D002-S02",
    "C39-D002-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 4.507,
   "end_sec": 10.631,
   "duration_sec": 6.124
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "パソコンなら「HDMI」です。入力ボタンを一回押せばいいですよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D003-S01",
    "C39-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 10.981,
   "end_sec": 15.939,
   "duration_sec": 4.958
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "見えました。この自然パークの写真を紹介します。動物を近くで見られるスポットなんです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D004-S01",
    "C39-D004-S02",
    "C39-D004-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 16.289,
   "end_sec": 22.273,
   "duration_sec": 5.984
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "この豚の毛は白いんですね。隣の山羊は前足を石に乗せていますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D005-S01",
    "C39-D005-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 22.623,
   "end_sec": 28.749,
   "duration_sec": 6.126
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "ええ。羊の「メーメー」という鳴き声も録音しました。ペットの犬がワンワン鳴いたら、羊も鳴いたんです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D006-S01",
    "C39-D006-S02",
    "C39-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "short_pause"
   ],
   "start_sec": 29.099,
   "end_sec": 36.145,
   "duration_sec": 7.046
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "動画もあるんですね。どうせ紹介するなら、音も聞いてもらうといいですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D007-S01",
    "C39-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 36.495,
   "end_sec": 41.931,
   "duration_sec": 5.436
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい。パンダや象は別の動物園で撮りました。狐の写真もありますが、多すぎますね。いっそ今日はこのパークだけにしましょうか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D008-S01",
    "C39-D008-S02",
    "C39-D008-S03",
    "C39-D008-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 42.281,
   "end_sec": 52.67,
   "duration_sec": 10.389
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "そうですね。この鳥小屋には鶏と雛がいますね。鳥の写真を使うというのなら、小鳥が飛ぶ動画も見せてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D009-S01",
    "C39-D009-S02",
    "C39-D009-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 53.02,
   "end_sec": 62.739,
   "duration_sec": 9.719
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "ありますよ。この動画では、鶴が羽ばたいています。蝶を撮ろうとしたら、蜘蛛の巣も写りました。熱帯魚は建物の中で撮りました。望遠鏡で雉を見た人もいました。亀は二匹いて、亀の甲の形を比べました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D010-S01",
    "C39-D010-S02",
    "C39-D010-S03",
    "C39-D010-S04",
    "C39-D010-S05",
    "C39-D010-S06"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 63.089,
   "end_sec": 80.579,
   "duration_sec": 17.49
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "見物人が多いですね。生き物が驚くと逃げてしまいます。一度逃げたら、同じ写真は撮れませんね。くねくねした道で立ち止まると、後ろの人が通れません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D011-S01",
    "C39-D011-S02",
    "C39-D011-S03",
    "C39-D011-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 80.929,
   "end_sec": 92.004,
   "duration_sec": 11.075
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "ええ。七時から七時半までは話し合いで、接続をやめます。途中で止まったら、どうしたらいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D012-S01",
    "C39-D012-S02",
    "C39-D012-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 92.354,
   "end_sec": 99.607,
   "duration_sec": 7.253
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "接続がないと十五分で止まります。話し合いの後で電源を入れればいいですよ。三十秒ほどすると使えます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D013-S01",
    "C39-D013-S02",
    "C39-D013-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 99.957,
   "end_sec": 107.83,
   "duration_sec": 7.873
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "それなら設定は変えません。来月の準備は別の人ですが、ケーブルがなければ借りられますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D014-S01",
    "C39-D014-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 108.18,
   "end_sec": 114.901,
   "duration_sec": 6.721
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "西田",
   "source_text": "予備は一本です。予約時に確かめてください。皆さんに写真を楽しんでもらえるといいですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D015-S01",
    "C39-D015-S02",
    "C39-D015-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 115.251,
   "end_sec": 121.923,
   "duration_sec": 6.672
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C39-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。今日は八時半に終わります。借りた物はありませんから、電源を切って九時までに帰ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C39-D016-S01",
    "C39-D016-S02",
    "C39-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
